# Raspberry Pi 5 | Docker Home Server

**A containerised, self-hosted infrastructure environment built on a Raspberry Pi 5, providing photo management, DNS filtering and network services.**

## Project Overview

This project involves deploying and maintaining a Raspberry Pi 5 as a continuously operating home server using Docker and Portainer.

The server hosts Immich for self-hosted photo management and AdGuard Home for network-level DNS filtering.

It has operated continuously for approximately four months with no observed downtime.

The project has provided practical experience in Linux administration, containerisation, networking, storage management and infrastructure reliability.

